<<~ ahu slot=`#/head`>>

! sense.content.searches ~ hybrid recall over one plane, the plane a parameter

`lares sense search <query…>` runs hybrid recall over one plane (`--lens`, default content; `crossplane` widens content hits across form and structure by the cid join), `--k` hits (default 5), narrowed by `--wing` and `--room`. `--not-root` (else `LARES_SESSION_ROOT`) down-weights the caller's own session by `--self-weight` (default 0.25). A frozen trial (`--trial-root`, with `--model-home` for the pinned query model) reads its owned Content and frontiers, filtered to its receipts, `--source-key` and `--revision` narrowing it. A leading sensorium name (`lares sense <sensorium> <verb>`) addresses any named sensorium; bare, the verb reads `memory`.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/shows`>>

!! shows ~ search · structure-plane

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`example` name=`search` params=`query/[[harbor lights]] ~ recall over the content plane`>>
<<has entity=`example` name=`structure-plane` params=`query/harbor lens/structure k/10 ~ ten hits over the structure plane`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/takes`>>

!! takes ~ query · lens · k · wing · room · not-root · self-weight · trial-root · model-home · source-key · revision

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`arg` name=`query` params=`takes/words needs/required seat/1 as/<query…> ~ the query`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`lens` params=`takes/plane default/content ~ the plane: content, structure, form, persistence, a named sensorium's own, or crossplane`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`k` params=`takes/count default/5 ~ how many hits`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`wing` params=`takes/name ~ one wing alone`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`room` params=`takes/name ~ one room alone`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`not-root` params=`takes/host-path ~ the session root to down-weight; else LARES_SESSION_ROOT`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`self-weight` params=`takes/number default/0.25 ~ the weight a hit from that root keeps`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`trial-root` params=`takes/host-path ~ a frozen trial's operation root`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`model-home` params=`takes/host-path ~ the pinned query model's home, which a trial search needs`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`source-key` params=`takes/key ~ narrow a trial search to one source key`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`revision` params=`takes/sha256 ~ narrow a trial search to one revision`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

